  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. Cook corn in the boiling water until tender and bright yellow, 5 minutes. Drain and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7c6c4b236b2c399e277c6-f7c43af3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 2cm thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Add the honey, turning haloumi to coat. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7c6c4b236b2c399e277c6-83738940.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place bake-at-home burger buns on a plate and microwave for 1 minute.\n• Halve bake-at-home burger buns. Place buns, cut-side up, on a lined oven tray and sprinkle with Cheddar cheese. Bake until cheese is melted, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7c6c4b236b2c399e277c6-f062d7c2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build your burgers by spreading a layer of dill & parsley mayonnaise on the base.\n• Dress the mixed salad leaves with mustard cider dressing.\n• Top bun bases with haloumi and a handful of mixed salad leaves.\n• Serve the burgers with the corn cobs (spread with a little butter if you like!) and the salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7c6c4b236b2c399e277c6-d76abb6e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
